/* ===== Privacy pane ===== */

/* Privacy pane statement. */
"CommandH works entirely on your computer. It only looks at which apps are running and whether each one is hidden, and that never leaves your computer or gets stored. No account, no analytics, and no permissions to grant." = "CommandH 完全在你的電腦上運作。它只會查看哪些應用程式正在執行，以及各自是否已隱藏，這些資訊絕不會離開你的電腦，也不會被儲存。不需要帳號，沒有分析功能，也不必授予任何權限。";

/* Card title in the Privacy pane. */
"Network activity" = "網路活動";

/* Network activity card text. */
"None. CommandH never connects to the internet on its own. The links in these settings open in your browser." = "無。CommandH 絕不會自行連上網際網路。這些設定中的連結會在你的瀏覽器中開啟。";

/* Link that opens the privacy policy in the browser. */
"Read the full privacy policy" = "閱讀完整隱私權政策";

